// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// BACKDROP  -- the FF7 / Chrono Cross / Oddworld trick: a 2D painted scene
// behind 3D actors, with walkmesh polygons defining where feet may go. The
// backdrop here is procedural (recipe + seed), never a shipped image.
